{"parse": {"title": "FT-07", "pageid": 55360, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-06\" title=\"FT-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-08\" title=\"FT-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A5.BD.E5.93.A5.E4.BB.AC.EF.BC.8C.E5.A5.BD.E4.B8.BB.E9.A1.BE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"好哥们，好主顾\">好哥们，好主顾</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 好哥们，好主顾</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Best Bud, Best Guest</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>把<span class=\"color-value\"></span>徽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>章<span class=\"color-value\"></span>塞<span class=\"color-value\"></span>进<span class=\"color-value\"></span>裤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>兜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>管<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>乐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>意<span class=\"color-value\"></span>搭<span class=\"color-value\"></span>把<span class=\"color-value\"></span>手<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机车缓缓驶入街巷，紧紧尾随的教众们已不知去向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的人们纷纷伸出了脑袋，啧啧称奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">管道工：</div><div>哈哈哈，J，你这是打哪儿拐了个小女孩回来，你难道不知道这帮吹牛打屁的糙汉子可没空帮你带孩子吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女侍者：</div><div>J——替我向先驱者先生问好！多亏他推荐的高跟鞋，那个好莱坞派头的导演一下子就看中我了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乞丐布莱恩：</div><div>G——您是叫G先生吗？我一直在找您……托您的福——这个徽章，救济院的特里斯终于愿意给我一张床，他说我明天就可以去做那份刷碗的工作了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乞丐布莱恩：</div><div>永别了，天台和臭水沟！谢谢您，朋友，谢谢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J停下车子，伸出手，紧紧握住了布莱恩颤抖的手掌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>噢，别这样，布、布——布莱恩！……你也帮我要到了那位漂亮妞的电话号码，不是吗？咱们这都是互帮互助，没有谁亏欠谁的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处，一位牵着魔精的男人走了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-621901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-621901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-621901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">魔精保姆：</div><div>嘿，我的好主顾J！你要借的最新一期《摩托女郎·特定本》到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-621901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-621901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-621901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">魔精保姆：</div><div>全是货真价实的好货——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J笑容可掬，踢起了脚撑，迅速拧紧油门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>回见，朋友们，回见！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-621901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-621901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-621901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">魔精保姆：</div><div>嘿，嘿，J……我在跟你说话呢，你还要不要这份杂志了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……那个家伙是不是正在喊你的名字？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309416.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309416.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309416.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309416.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309416.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309416.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309416.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309416.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>抱歉，我没听见，机车的嗡鸣声实在是太大了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>还有，你背后的这把怪东西都硌疼我了，你为什么就非得一直带着它？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309416.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309416.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309416.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309416.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309416.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309416.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309416.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309416.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>噢……这是我老爸留下来的东西，已经跟了我很多年啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>它到底是什么……东西？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309416.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309416.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309416.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309416.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309416.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309416.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309416.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309416.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>抓紧！……小家伙，我们就要到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们安详地躺卧在桌面上，周围的男人们摩挲着胡须，琢磨着它们的老家身在何处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-626114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-626114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-626114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>这就是我从那个敲铃人的口袋里掏出来的所有东西了……除了屁*，相信我，我已经把能掏的东西都掏了一遍了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>噢！霍利克，你敲我的头干嘛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>呃，J说过，你每说一句脏话，就得给你一个“榔头”，让你长长记性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>嗯……我是说过这话……咱们都得嘴巴放干净点儿。瞧瞧，这不是还有位淑女正站在我们旁边么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>……没想到我一直以来不受待见的绅士主张，竟然在这个时候通通实现了，感谢您的指导，玛蒂尔达小姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一旁的女孩正捣鼓着复杂的仪器，丝毫没有理会这边的盛况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">系统音：</div><div>欢迎使用SPF-I型便携联络装置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">系统音：</div><div>……验证成功。登录人员：玛蒂尔达·布翁尼。目前开放权限等级——B。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304122.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304122.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>成功了！哼哼，今非昔比，如今作为特派调查员的玛蒂尔达已经拥有了更高的权限！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">系统音：</div><div>“紧急支援申请”——抱歉，目前紧急支援小队正被派遣于其他调查任务中，您的周边未发现异常神秘学波动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">系统音：</div><div>请汇报具体讯息，以核实评估是否具备紧急支援的条件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">系统音：</div><div>哔、哔、哔——您的讯息已送达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">系统音：</div><div>系统将以支援优先级排序，为您安排支援。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唉……早知道就提前申请给我的小队多派一些成员了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这个蠢机器真是什么忙都帮不上……为了准确地传达情报，还得让我仅有的两位队员将调查报告带回去做进一步评估。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>只能寄希望于他们能够加快支援申请的进度了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>哦？申请支援？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>所以你也打算掺和一脚？哈哈哈哈，不得不说，我开始欣赏你这个气势汹汹的小家伙了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>才不是掺和一脚！你可是搞错了，圣洛夫基金会将以独立的方式处理这件事，我们不会让你们这些平民参与其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你们只需要为我们提供重要的线索就够了。玛蒂尔达会带领她的小队，出色地解决这些难题～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她正伸手打算拿起桌上的钥匙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但一张宽大的手掌，迅速盖到了钥匙之上——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我不接受你的提议，小家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>在座的所有人，没有谁会把命运交到别人手里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>如果你想要消息，你就得答应我们——我们能亲自解决麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他并没有将手挪开的意思，直直盯着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>呃——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这已经有违调查员守则，需要经过特殊批准……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>小家伙，不管你能不能保证，我可以看在你尽职的份儿上为你开个绿灯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>但是，不管最后结果如何——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我不会把那些让海特街千疮百孔的混账亲手让给你。这不是为了狭隘意义上的复仇——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>而是因为，海特街的人，只相信由自己亲手伸张的道义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我们早就不寄希望于法官、警察、圣洛夫基金会……所谓给予公平、正义的这些家伙，在海特街，我们宁愿相信过街老鼠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>至少它们挨过打，也挨过失望的折磨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>它们不会扭头忘记穷人的祈求，也不会自以为是什么拯救他人于水火的救世主。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他挪开了手，将钥匙递给了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我们只相信一起蹚过阴沟的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她接过钥匙，沉甸甸的，仿佛有某种沉重的东西依附其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这就是重塑之手所谓……通往“乐园”的钥匙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>环状水星……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他抬了抬头，示意她把说明接续下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>玛蒂尔达小姐，他们借由钥匙，躲藏在某处……一个只属于他们的狂欢之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我曾瞧见那些返途的人，回来以后都陷入了某种可怖的神往……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>自那之后，他们的灵魂与身躯被完全拴上了锁链……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我见过最自负的商人在他们脚下卑躬屈膝，而其中一位最虔诚的信徒，一位母亲……将尚在襁褓中的孩子饿死在垃圾堆里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>许多从集市归来的友人，一个个失去了意志，像着了魔似的在街区中乱窜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>再之后，他们便完全失去了踪影，成了盖棺定论的失踪者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摇摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你的意思是说……除非我们先找到属于钥匙的唯一的那扇门，把他们从老鼠洞里揪出来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>否则，整个行动都将化为泡影？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她差点儿要站起身来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>不，还远不止这些……他们为了后天的庆典，已经摆出了前所未有的阵仗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩抢答般举起了手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>我还听见那些哭哭啼啼的傻大个，嘟嘟囔囔地说什么“最后的启示”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>他们那副可怜兮兮的样子就像在电玩厅里输光了饭钱的穷鬼一样，哈哈哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>“最后的启示”……是指重塑之手在集市最后一次开启“乐园”之门的意思吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默席卷而来，所有人都知道这意味着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>届时，我们将会失去他们所有人的去向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>J……你知道有不少我们曾经的朋友加入了他们。告诉我……等到那天，如果曾经的朋友将刀尖指向你，你会怎样阻拦他们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>如果这群迷途的羔羊，将心甘情愿地跳往悬崖……你觉得我们又该怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他并不躲避。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>……我们总得取舍，环状水星。我从不妄想能救所有人，或者说，我早就放弃了那种不切实际的幻想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这令多数人心中沉重的答案，却令她前所未有地释怀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一方的支持来得很快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我暂且……赞同这个家伙说的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>而且，我们总可以提前做点儿什么准备！圣洛夫基金会的支援还在途中，在此之前，我们都不要打草惊蛇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我打算潜入他们，多收集一些讯息，说不定还能把那扇门找出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扶住了下颚，陷入了思索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>别担心，玛蒂尔达小姐，我明天会为你介绍我的朋友与我所扎根的新纪元集市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>不过，你确实得换一身装束，不管我的朋友有没有跟那帮人产生过纠葛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>呵呵，圣洛夫基金会的人员在这里都不太受到待见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>噢……对了！而且环状水星女士恰好认识那位叫作杰洛的先生，我们还可以从他口中拿到不少线索和消息！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>杰洛？抱歉，我……不认识你所说的这位先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她并没有开玩笑的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>可、可我应该没有记错，他就是你刚才接待的那位客人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>不……玛蒂尔达小姐，我先前并没有接待任何客人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>J，你也没有看见吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他别过脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>呃……我只看见了一个小家伙，不怀好意，偷偷摸摸地窥视着帐篷……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这场匪夷所思的记忆错乱，并没有得到应有的解答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-07"}}